1
00:00:00,412 --> 00:00:02,912
(Raj:)Now him, he's one of those geeks.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,090
(Sheldon:)All right, now before you enter
my bedroom unescorted...

3
00:00:07,253 --> 00:00:10,383
(Sheldon:)...I need you to understand
that this one time grant of access...

4
00:00:10,548 --> 00:00:13,678
(Sheldon:)...does not create a permanent easement.

5
00:00:14,385 --> 00:00:15,515
(Sheldon:)Easement.

6
00:00:17,054 --> 00:00:20,184
It's a legal right of access. Good grief.

7
00:00:22,101 --> 00:00:25,481
What? No, don't put me on hold. I...
Oh...

8
00:00:27,273 --> 00:00:28,733
HOWARD:
Do you believe him?

9
00:00:28,899 --> 00:00:33,199
(Howard:)Normally around women,
he has the personality of a boiled potato.

10
00:00:33,362 --> 00:00:36,612
(Howard:)Put one beer in him,
and he's M. Knight Charmalarmalon.

11
00:00:40,286 --> 00:00:42,666
(Leonard:)Is that what he's drinking?
It's not even real beer.

12
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:44,040
(Penny:)- What?
- Look at it.

13
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:47,130
(Leonard:)Non-alcoholic beer.

14
00:00:48,544 --> 00:00:50,544
- Then what's going on?
- I don't know.

15
00:00:50,713 --> 00:00:53,303
(Leonard:)Some sort of placebo effect, I guess.

16
00:00:53,924 --> 00:00:55,924
(Howard:)Placebo, you say.

17
00:00:56,093 --> 00:00:58,133
(Sheldon:)Interesting.

18
00:00:58,304 --> 00:01:01,024
(Sheldon:)Yes, I'm still here.
Where am I going? I'm on a train.

